 sabadh kahu bahur uchaaro ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਫਿਰ (ਉਸ ਵਿਚ) 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।"}}},{"verse_id":107995,"page_no":761,"line_no":107995,"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਸਕਲ ਬਿਚਾਰੋ ॥੮੧੮॥","translit_en":"naam tupak ke sakal bichaaro ||818||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"After firstly saying “Karaar-arini”, utter the words “Jaachar-nayak and shatru” nad consider all the names of Tupak.818."},"pu":{"ss":"(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਭ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝੋ ॥੮੧੮॥"}}},{"verse_id":107996,"page_no":761,"line_no":107996,"gurmukhi":"ਕਲੁਨਾਸਨਨਿ ਆਦਿ ਭਣਿਜੈ ॥","translit_en":"kalunaasanan aadh bhanijai ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਕਲੁਨਾਸਨਨਿ' (ਪਾਪ ਨਾਸ਼ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੀ ਗੰਗਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹੋ।"}}},{"verse_id":107997,"page_no":761,"line_no":107997,"gurmukhi":"ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਦਿਜੈ ॥","translit_en":"jaa char keh naik padh dhijai ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"(ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।"}}},{"verse_id":107998,"page_no":761,"line_no":107998,"gurmukhi":"ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਤਿਹ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਰੀਐ ॥","translit_en":"satr sabadh teh a(n)t uchareeaai ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਉਸ ਦੇ ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।"}}},{"verse_id":107999,"page_no":761,"line_no":107999,"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਸਕਲ ਬਿਚਰੀਐ ॥੮੧੯॥","translit_en":"naam tupak ke sakal bichareeaai ||819||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"Saying firstly the word “Kalinaasini” and adding the words “Jaachar-nayak” and then uttering the word “Shatru” at the end, consider the names of Tupak.819."},"pu":{"ss":"ਇਸ ਨੂੰ ਸਭ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੮੧੯॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":9533,"next":9535}}